        "supporting_quote": "Overall, encorafenib plus binimetinib achieved an ORR of 58.3% (95% CI, 44.9-70.9), with three patients (5.0%) showing a CR and 32 (53.3%) showing a PR as their best response ( Figure 1 ). Responses were achieved after a median of 2.4 months (95% CI, 2.1-3.1) and lasted for a median DoR of 6.5 months (95% CI, 4.2-8.6). The ORR was 59.6% (95% CI, 45.1-73.0) and 50% (95% CI, 15.7-84.3) in patients treated with first- and second-line encorafenib plus binimetinib, respectively. The icORR was 46.7% (95% CI, 33.7-60.0), with 3 patients (5%) achieving an icCR. The median icDoR was 8.3 months (95% CI, 3.5-11.9) ( Supplementary Figure S1 )."
